":[["Eagle County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/eagle-county"],["ARC or PLC in Eagle County","/arc-plc/colorado/eagle-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, June to July came in at 55% and November to December at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June sits at 54% of normal. Grid 23492 had its driest year in 2025 at 68%.</p>"}
